      "text": "Five free days by the sea.\n\nThere are no scheduled excursions during this time.\n\nRelax on the beach or choose optional activities and excursions at your own pace.\n\nBreakfast is included each day.\n\nAfter the more active part of the itinerary among volcanoes and forests, spend a few days taking it easy."
